/* The trailing space is DELIBERATE and load-bearing, not a typo: on-device bisection
   (2026-07-21, lavasec-ios-internal#434/#435) showed the Live Activity button renderer draws
   short SPACE-LESS ja values ("再開", "15分") as a bare truncation ellipsis while every ja value
   containing a space ("15 分間一時停止", the titles) renders — same file, same code, same build.
   zh/ko space-less values are unaffected, isolating iOS's ja-specific text segmentation in that
   render context. The space is invisible in the drawn label and in VoiceOver. Do not "clean" it
   without re-verifying ja on device. Record: lavasec-infra
   plans/2026-07-21-live-activity-ja-label-probe-removal-contract.md. */
"widget.action.resume" = "再開 ";
"widget.action.restart" = "再接続";
"widget.action.pauseForMinutes" = "%d 分間一時停止";
/* Compact Pause-button label (duration only; the pause glyph carries the verb). Full phrase:
   widget.action.pauseForMinutes. The TRAILING space is deliberate — the same render rescue as
   widget.action.resume above, and the field-correct one: the internally-spaced "%d 分" variant
   drew as "15…" on device (2026-07-21, lavasec-ios-internal#437 build) because the internal
   space made a break point whose final segment — bare 分, a short space-less ja run — collapsed
   exactly like the unspaced values did. Trailing space, no internal space. */
"widget.action.pauseForMinutesShort" = "%d分 ";
"a11y.shieldGuardian" = "Lava Guard";

